m, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 1rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="home-list_paragraph">Radiation-tolerant architectures, redundant avionics, and high-Δv propulsion means our satellites are built for resilience and longevity across every orbit.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="home-list"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="home-item"><div class="css-grid"><div data-w-id="9f0e8b77-a732-f43c-8ecd-658ee7e073cf" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 1rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 1rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 1rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 1rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="heading-style-h3 is-list">03</div><div id="w-node-_9f0e8b77-a732-f43c-8ecd-658ee7e073d1-2b219403" data-w-id="9f0e8b77-a732-f43c-8ecd-658ee7e073d1" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 1rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 1rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 1rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 1rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="heading-style-h3 is-list">Scale Ready</div><div id="w-node-_9f0e8b77-a732-f43c-8ecd-658ee7e073d3-2b219403" data-w-id="9f0e8b77-a732-f43c-8ecd-658ee7e073d3" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 1rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 1rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 1rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 1rem, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="home-list_paragraph">A design optimized for mass production combined with a fully vertically integrated hardware stack.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="home-list_button"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="css-grid"><a id="w-node-_8a52703c-231c-3cfc-3537-cac44f17369d-2b219403" href="#" class="button is-icon w-inline-block"><div>Learn more&nbsp;&nbsp;→</div></a></div></div></div></div></section><section data-w-id="c2f42635-f341-dcb2-334a-f0362e2b2b72" class="section_planet"><div class="spacer-xhuge"></div><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="planet_component"><div class="planet_header"><h2 words-slide-from-right="" text-split="" class="heading-style-h2" style="opacity: 1;"><span class="line" style="display: block; text-align: start; width: 100%; translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate(0px, 0px); opacity: 1;">Our satellites are built to</span><span class="line" style="display: block; text-align: start; width: 100%; translate: none; rotate: none; scale: none; transform: translate(0px, 0px); opacity: 1;">thrive where others can’t</span></h2></div><div class="planet_wrapper"><div data-w-id="1e74ebba-86a8-4320-5c3e-34df10880a37" class="planet_sticky"><div class="planet_info-wrapper hide-tablet"><div class="planet_nav"><a id="leo" data-w-id="3511cec4-02b6-91a9-7065-15591050cc67" href="#" class="planet_nav-item is-leo w-inline-block"><div>LEO</div></a><a data-w-id="b6e9fe50-f9e3-9bfd-18f2-18ddeecd7749" href="#" class="planet_nav-item is-meo w-inline-block"><div>MEO</div></a><a data-w-id="333a4511-5d18-128a-25f9-307de2321a55" href="#" class="planet_nav-item is-geo w-inline-block"><div>GEO</div></a></div><div class="planet-info_wrapper hide-tablet"><div style="opacity:1" class="planet_info is-leo"><div class="planet_info-group"><div class="planet_info-item"><div>Temperature</div><div class="text-color-secondary">545Fº</div></div><div class="planet_info-item"><div>Deeper orbits are where</div><div class="text-color-secondary">coverage and comms become</div></div><div class="planet_info-item"><div>Distance from earth</div><div class="text-color-secondary">564.545.000 km</div></div><div class="planet_info-item"><div>Deeper orbits are where</div><div class="text-color-secondary">coverage and comms become</div></div></div><div>Low Earth Orbit is well suited for missions that rely on proximity to Earth. With K2’s high-power platforms and advanced propulsion systems, LEO becomes a powerful domain for sensing and for applications where ultra-low latency still matters.</div></div><div style="opacity:0" class="planet_info is-meo"><div>Medium Earth Orbit is the sweet spot. MEO provides global reach while maintaining strong network performance. K2’s MEO systems unlock efficient, resilient, and scalable constellations, without the complexity of operating hundreds of LEO spacecrafts.</div><div class="planet_info-group"><div class="planet_info-item"><div>Temperature</div><div class="text-color-secondary">545Fº</div></div><div class="planet_info-item"><div>Deeper orbits are where</div><div class="text-color-secondary">coverage and comms become</div></div><div class="planet_info-item"><div>Distance from earth</div><div class="text-color-secondary">564.545.000 km</div></div><div class="planet_info-item"><div>Deeper orbits are where</div><div class="text-color-secondary">coverage and comms become</div></div></div></div><div style="opacity:0" class="planet_info is-geo"><div>Geostationary orbit anchors the world’s most trusted broadcast and communications. Our GEO satellites deliver high power, long life, and continuous regional coverage, extending K2 capability all the way to 36,000 km.</div><div class="planet_info-group"><div class="planet_info-item"><div>Temperature</div><div class="text-color-secondary">545Fº</div></div><div class="planet_info-item"><div>Deeper orbits are where</div><div class="text-color-secondary">coverage and comms become</div></div><div class="planet_info-item"><div>Distance from earth</div><div class="text-color-secondary">564.545.000 km</div></div><div class="planet_info-item"><div>Deeper orbits are where</div><div class="text-color-secondary">coverage and comms become</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="planet_image-scroll"><div data-poster-url="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f94692305c424b2500e672%2F692df77dc06c63a0dc208452_earth-compressed_poster.0000000.jpg" data-video-urls="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b219515_earth-compressed_mp4.mp4,https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b219515_earth-compressed_webm.webm" data-autoplay="true" data-loop="true" data-wf-ignore="true" class="planet w-background-video w-background-video-atom"><video id="22a72658-3389-4c50-19a9-c554044feafe-video" autoplay="" loop="" style="background-image:url(&quot;https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68f94692305c424b2500e672%2F692df77dc06c63a0dc208452_earth-compressed_poster.0000000.jpg&quot;)" muted="" playsinline="" data-wf-ignore="true" data-object-fit="cover"><source src="/assets-f/media/cf29fe1911c027.mp4" data-wf-ignore="true"><source src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b219515_earth-compressed_webm.webm" data-wf-ignore="true"></video></div><div data-w-id="8a80bb6a-a6cc-790f-5384-0dbceb846caa" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="leo" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b219532_leo-v2.json" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0" data-duration="10" data-loading="eager"></div><div data-w-id="1118cfe0-7126-e47e-a58b-5ac9cd424494" data-is-ix2-target="1" class="meo" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="