ver high power, long life, and continuous regional coverage, extending K2 capability all the way to 36,000 km.</div><div class="planet_info-group"><div class="planet_info-item"><div>Temperature</div><div class="text-color-secondary">545Fº</div></div><div class="planet_info-item"><div>Deeper orbits are where</div><div class="text-color-secondary">coverage and comms become</div></div><div class="planet_info-item"><div>Distance from earth</div><div class="text-color-secondary">564.545.000 km</div></div><div class="planet_info-item"><div>Deeper orbits are where</div><div class="text-color-secondary">coverage and comms become</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_testimonials"><div class="padding-global full-height"><div class="container-large full-height"><div class="testimonials_wrapper"><div data-w-id="9c73e3a6-3682-58db-bc12-694fe30a7d3f" class="heading-style-h2">"The industry went small. We asked: what happens if you go the other way?"</div><div data-w-id="580562f8-ce5f-4592-27c4-0ff65ffa240a">Neel Kunjur, Chief Technical Officer</div><a data-w-id="bde5ba17-f7ec-76fc-fe2a-4b3631455095" href="#" class="button w-button">Learn more →</a></div><div class="testimonials_bg"><div class="testimonials_overlay"></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b2194d2_quote%20image.webp" loading="lazy" data-w-id="2b44e5a7-9355-2c3d-c573-80747143f954" sizes="(max-width: 2283px) 100vw, 2283px" alt="" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b2194d2_quote%2520image-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b2194d2_quote%2520image-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b2194d2_quote%2520image-p-1080.webp 1080w, /assets-f/img/5c185284104d01.webp 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69333244a7b7aea22b21941a/69333244a7b7aea22b2194d2_